  "markdown": "## Exchange Rate and Interest Rate Relationship

- **Parameter Consideration**: We may treat the exchange rate as a parameter, but we will not internalize (endogenize) it in the model.
- **Objective**: Seek an explicit **equation** that defines the exchange rate.
- **Key Insight**: An **increase in the domestic interest rate**, holding all else constant, leads to an **appreciation of the exchange rate**."
}
